------------------------------------------------
`shamsu/agents/simple_log.py` writes `.shamsu/chat-logs/<session>.md`: a
FOURTH destination, holding the full prompt and raw response verbatim for
simple mode. It overlaps `log-detailed.md` almost exactly. Folding it in means
deleting a working, tested verbatim archive, which is a product call rather
than a refactor. Left running; both files are written today.
